{
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "cues": [
    {
      "id": "voyager-cue-1",
      "transcript": "Over fifteen billion miles away, Voyager One was sending signals nobody could read.",
      "file": "audio/voyager/narration/cue-1.wav",
      "start": 0,
      "duration": 5.95,
      "beatIndex": 0,
      "sourceScriptSegmentId": "voyager-memory.asset.remote-repair.script.1",
      "samples": 142800,
      "sampleRate": 24000
    },
    {
      "id": "voyager-cue-2",
      "transcript": "The trouble began in November twenty twenty-three: a failed memory chip in its data-packaging computer.",
      "file": "audio/voyager/narration/cue-2.wav",
      "start": 6.233333333333333,
      "duration": 6.9,
      "beatIndex": 1,
      "sourceScriptSegmentId": "voyager-memory.asset.remote-repair.script.2",
      "samples": 165600,
      "sampleRate": 24000
    },
    {
      "id": "voyager-cue-3",
      "transcript": "Engineers couldn't repair the chip. So they moved the affected code.",
      "file": "audio/voyager/narration/cue-3.wav",
      "start": 13.4,
      "duration": 4.4,
      "beatIndex": 2,
      "sourceScriptSegmentId": "voyager-memory.asset.remote-repair.script.3",
      "samples": 105600,
      "sampleRate": 24000
    },
    {
      "id": "voyager-cue-4",
      "transcript": "But it wouldn't fit in one place.",
      "file": "audio/voyager/narration/cue-4.wav",
      "start": 18.1,
      "duration": 2.15,
      "beatIndex": 3,
      "sourceScriptSegmentId": "voyager-memory.asset.remote-repair.script.4",
      "samples": 51600,
      "sampleRate": 24000
    },
    {
      "id": "voyager-cue-5",
      "transcript": "They split it across working memory, then updated the instructions so the pieces still worked together.",
      "file": "audio/voyager/narration/cue-5.wav",
      "start": 20.733333333333334,
      "duration": 6.425,
      "beatIndex": 4,
      "sourceScriptSegmentId": "voyager-memory.asset.remote-repair.script.5",
      "samples": 154200,
      "sampleRate": 24000
    },
    {
      "id": "voyager-cue-6",
      "transcript": "A command took about twenty-two and a half hours just to reach the spacecraft.",
      "file": "audio/voyager/narration/cue-6.wav",
      "start": 27.633333333333333,
      "duration": 4.875,
      "beatIndex": 5,
      "sourceScriptSegmentId": "voyager-memory.asset.remote-repair.script.6",
      "samples": 117000,
      "sampleRate": 24000
    },
    {
      "id": "voyager-cue-7",
      "transcript": "On April twentieth, twenty twenty-four, readable engineering data came back. Science data followed later.",
      "file": "audio/voyager/narration/cue-7.wav",
      "start": 32.9,
      "duration": 7.25,
      "beatIndex": 6,
      "sourceScriptSegmentId": "voyager-memory.asset.remote-repair.script.7",
      "samples": 174000,
      "sampleRate": 24000
    },
    {
      "id": "voyager-cue-8",
      "transcript": "The chip stayed broken. The software worked around it.",
      "file": "audio/voyager/narration/cue-8.wav",
      "start": 40.53333333333333,
      "duration": 3.625,
      "beatIndex": 7,
      "sourceScriptSegmentId": "voyager-memory.asset.remote-repair.script.8",
      "samples": 87000,
      "sampleRate": 24000
    }
  ],
